"t":"l"},{"he":"הסופר כתב ספר חדש.","en":"The writer wrote a new book.","alt":["The author wrote a new book."],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני קורא ספרות עברית.","en":"I read Hebrew literature.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המספר הזה לא נכון.","en":"This number is not correct.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הספריה פתוחה בבוקר.","en":"The library is open in the morning.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכתיבה שלה ברורה.","en":"Her writing is clear.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"כתבתי לך מכתב ארוך.","en":"I wrote you a long letter.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הכתובת השתנתה.","en":"The address changed.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"יש הרבה ספרים בספריה.","en":"There are many books in the library.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסיפור הזה ארוך מדי.","en":"This story is too long.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"השורש של המילה הוא ס.פ.ר.","en":"The root of the word is S.P.R.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"מי כתב את הספר הזה?","en":"Who wrote this book?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הספרות המודרנית מעניינת.","en":"Modern literature is interesting.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני צריך את המספר שלו.","en":"I need his number.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הספריה הכי גדולה בארץ.","en":"The biggest library in the country.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכתיבה היא אמנות.","en":"Writing is an art.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הסופר סיפר סיפור יפה.","en":"The writer told a beautiful story.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"שלחתי מכתב לסבתא שלי.","en":"I sent a letter to my grandmother.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכתובת של הספריה השתנתה.","en":"The address of the library changed.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"ספרות ילדים חשובה מאוד.","en":"Children's literature is very important.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המספרים בעברית קשים ללמוד.","en":"Numbers in Hebrew are hard to learn.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסופרת כתבה סיפור קצר.","en":"The writer wrote a short story.","alt":["The female author wrote a short story."],"t":"l"},{"he":"אני לומד כתיבה יצירתית.","en":"I study creative writing.","alt":["I'm learning creative writing."],"t":"t"},{"he":"כל הספרים על המדף שלי.","en":"All the books are on my shelf.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא סיפר לי סיפור מצחיק.","en":"He told me a funny story.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הספריה העירונית גדולה וחדשה.","en":"The municipal library is big and new.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסופרים הישראלים ידועים בעולם.","en":"Israeli writers are known in the world.","alt":["Israeli authors are world-famous."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הכתובת שכתבת לא נכונה.","en":"The address you wrote is not correct.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"קראתי את כל הספרים של הסופר הזה.","en":"I read all of this writer's books.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"המכתב שלו היה מלא שגיאות כתיבה.","en":"His letter was full of spelling mistakes.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הספרות העברית התחילה לפני אלפי שנים.","en":"Hebrew literature began thousands of years ago.","alt":[],"t":"t"}],"hints":{"זה":"this / that / it","ספר":"book","טוב":"good","מה":"what","הסיפור":"the story","הוא":"he / it","סופר":"writer / author","מפורסם":"famous","אני":"I / I am","אוהב":"love / like","ספרות":"literature","המספר":"the number","שלך":"your / yours","הספריה":"the library","סגורה":"closed (f.)","היום":"today","הכתיבה":"the writing","שלו":"his","יפה":"beautiful","יש":"there is / there are","לי":"to me / I have","מכתב":"letter","חדש":"new","הכתובת":"the address","הספר":"the book","הזה":"this (m.)","ארוך":"long","מאוד":"very","שלה":"her / hers","מרגש":"moving / exciting","כתב":"wrote","קורא":"read / reading","עברית":"Hebrew","לא":"not / no","נכון":"correct / right","פתוחה":"open (f.)","בבוקר":"in the morning","ברורה":"clear (f.)","כתבתי":"I wrote","לך":"to you / for you","השתנתה":"changed (f.)","הרבה":"many / a lot","ספרים":"books","בספריה":"in the library","מדי":"too (much)","השורש":"the root","של":"of","המילה":"the word","מי":"who","את":"(acc.)","המודרנית":"the modern (f.)","מעניינת":"interesting (f.)","צריך":"need / must","הכי":"the most","גדולה":"big / large (f.)","בארץ":"in the country","היא":"she / it","אמנות":"art","הסופר":"the writer / the author","סיפר":"told / related","סיפור":"story","שלחתי":"I sent","לסבתא":"to grandmother","שלי":"my / mine","ילדים":"children","חשובה":"important (f.)","המספרים":"the numbers","בעברית":"in Hebrew","קשים":"hard / difficult (pl.)","ללמוד":"to learn","הסופרת":"the writer (f.) / the author (f.)","כתבה":"wrote (f.)","קצר":"short","לומד":"study / learn","כתיבה":"writing","יצירתית":"creative (f.)","כל":"all / every","הספרים":"the books","על":"on","המדף":"the shelf","מצחיק":"funny","העירונית":"the municipal (f.)","וחדשה":"and new","הסופרים":"the writers / the authors","הישראלים":"the Israelis","ידועים":"known / famous (pl.)","בעולם":"in the world","שכתבת":"that you wrote","נכונה":"correct (f.)","קראתי":"I read (past)","היה":"was","מלא":"full","שגיאות":"mistakes / errors","התחילה":"began (f.)","לפני":"before / ago","אלפי":"thousands of","שנים":"years","העברית":"the Hebrew","עשירה":"rich (f.)","מעניין":"interesting"},"words":[{"he":"ספר","en":"book","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sefer"},{"he":"סיפור","en":"story","alt":["tale"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sipur"},{"he":"מספר","en":"number","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"mispar"},{"he":"ספריה","en":"library","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sifriyah"},{"he":"ספרות","en":"literature","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sifrut"},{"he":"סופר","en":"writer","alt":["author"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sofer"},{"he":"כתב","en":"wrote","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"katav"},{"he":"מכתב","en":"letter","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"mikhtav"},{"he":"כתובת","en":"address","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ktovet"},{"he":"כתיבה","en":"writing","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ktivah"},{"he":"שורש","en":"root","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"shoresh"},{"he":"הסופרת","en":"the writer (f.)","alt":["the author (f.)"],"from":"skill","tr":"hasoferet"},{"he":"כתבה","en":"wrote (f.)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"katvah"},{"he":"כתבתי","en":"I wrote","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"katavti"},{"he":"סיפר","en":"told","alt":["related"],"from":"skill","tr":"siper"},{"he":"הכתובת","en":"the address","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"haktovet"},{"he":"המספרים","en":"the numbers","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"hamisparim"},{"he":"הספרים","en":"the books","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hasfarim"},{"he":"הסופר","en":"the writer","alt":["the author"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hasofer"},{"he":"בספריה","en":"in the library","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"basifriyah"}],"lexemes":["ספר","סיפור","מספר","ספריה","ספרות","סופר","כתב","מכתב","כתובת","כתיבה","שורש","הסופרת","כתבה","כתבתי","סיפר","הכתובת","המספרים","הספרים","הסופר","בספריה","ספרים","הספריה","הכתיבה","הסיפור","השורש","שכתבת","הסופרים","שגיאות"],"tips":"## The Hebrew Root System (שורש)\n\nHebrew words are built from **three-letter roots** (שורשים). By adding vowels, prefixes, and suffixes to a root, Hebrew creates entire families of related words.\n\n### Root ס.פ.ר (S.P.R) — related to counting, telling, books\n\n| Word | Transliteration | Meaning |\n|------|----------------|----------|\n| סֵפֶר | sefer | book |\n| סִפּוּר | sipur | story |\n| מִסְפָּר | mispar | number |\n| סִפְרִיָּה | sifriyah | library |\n| סִפְרוּת | sifrut | literature |\n| סוֹפֵר | sofer | writer/author |\n| סִפֵּר | siper | told/related |\n\n### Root כ.ת.ב (K.T.V) — related to writing\n\n| Word | Transliteration | Meaning |\n|------|----------------|----------|\n| כָּתַב | katav | wrote |\n| מִכְתָּב | mikhtav | letter |\n| כְּתֹבֶת | ktovet | address |\n| כְּתִיבָה | ktivah | writing |\n\n### How It Works\nThe root carries the **core meaning**. Different patterns (called **משקלים** — mishkalim) create different word types:\n- **מִ___ָ_** (mi__a_) → place/tool: סִפְרִיָּה (library = place of books)\n- **מִ___ָ_** (mi__a_) → noun: מִכְתָּב (letter = thing written)\n- **___ָה** (___ah) → abstract noun: כְּתִיבָה (writing)"}